coder › Fixed off-by-one in `paginate` and added edge-case tests.

Changes:
- `src/paginate.ts`: `start` is now `(page - 1) * perPage` (was `page * perPage`, which skipped page 1). Added `RangeError` when `page < 1` or `perPage < 1`. `slice` naturally returns the remainder on the last page and `[]` past the end.
- `src/paginate.test.ts`: added 5 tests — page 1 returns first `perPage` items, last page returns remainder, past-end page returns `[]`, `page < 1` throws `RangeError`, `perPage < 1` throws `RangeError`.

